What is the output of the following Java program featuring a custom unchecked exception?
```java
class OrderNotFoundException extends RuntimeException {
    public OrderNotFoundException(String id) { super(id); }
}
public class OrderService {
    public static void lookup(String id) {
        throw new OrderNotFoundException("ID:" + id);
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            lookup("404");
        } catch (OrderNotFoundException e) {
            System.out.println(e.getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

